{#
  « Incidents et dégâts » on the renter's tracking page (#980, §22.5): the
  decided incidents — what was observed, the day it was, and « Facturé : … »
  or « Non facturé » — and, while one is still being assessed, a single
  sentence and nothing else.

  `renter_incidents` (RentalStayService::renterIncidents(), or null) holds
  no description, amount or internal text of an incident under assessment,
  and no waive reason at all: they are never built for this page, so there
  is nothing here to forget to hide (ARCHITECTURE.md §7.6, rule 3). Absent
  while there is no incident.

  Included from tracking.html.twig with one line, so the page around it
  stays whose it is.
#}
{% if renter_incidents and not renter_incidents.isEmpty %}
    <div class="card mb-4" id="incidents">
        <div class="card-body">
            <h2 class="h5 mb-3">Incidents et dégâts</h2>
            {% if renter_incidents.assessmentInProgress %}
                <p class="alert alert-info small {{ renter_incidents.decided is empty ? 'mb-0' : 'mb-3' }}"
                   data-renter-incident-assessment>
                    {% if renter_incidents_deposit ?? false %}
                        Un dégât est en cours d'évaluation ; la caution reste retenue jusqu'à son règlement.
                    {% else %}
                        Un dégât constaté pendant votre séjour est en cours d'évaluation.
                    {% endif %}
                </p>
            {% endif %}
            {% if renter_incidents.decided is not empty %}
                <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0">
                    {% for incident in renter_incidents.decided %}
                        <li class="{{ loop.last ? '' : 'border-bottom mb-2 pb-2' }}" data-renter-incident>
                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start gap-2">
                                <span>
                                    {{ incident.description }}
                                    <span class="small text-body-secondary d-block">
                                        Constaté le {{ incident.reportedAt|date_fr }}
                                    </span>
                                </span>
                                <span class="text-end text-nowrap">
                                    {% if incident.isCharged %}
                                        Facturé : {{ incident.chargedCents|money_cents }}
                                    {% else %}
                                        Non facturé
                                    {% endif %}
                                </span>
                            </div>
                        </li>
                    {% endfor %}
                </ul>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
    </div>
{% endif %}
